      <profileDesc>
         <abstract><p>Though this malkǝʾ, transmitted in <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ANLcr23 ">Rome, Biblioteca dell’Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei, Conti Rossini 23</ref>, is described by   <bibl>
            <ptr target="bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue"/>
            <citedRange unit="page">82</citedRange>
         </bibl> as
            being for <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS1640Alaniqos">ʾAlāniqos</persName>, it seems more likely that it is actually
            for his student Taṭamqa Madḫǝn, see <bibl><ptr target="bm:Marrassini1982Alaniqos"/><citedRange unit="page">146</citedRange></bibl>. </p></abstract>
